{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07906","headline":"西山寻辛谔 · 孟浩然","name":"西山寻辛谔","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"漾舟寻水便，因访故人居。\n落日清川里，谁言独羡鱼。\n石潭窥洞彻，沙岸历纡徐。\n竹屿见垂钓，茅斋闻读书。\n款言忘景夕，清兴属凉初。\n回也一瓢饮，贤哉常晏如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07906.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07906","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}